#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:139
msgid "Locale selection and locale-retention settings."
msgstr "Pengaturan pemilihan locale dan retensi locale."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:148
msgid ""
"CondinAPT can use an unmapped full variable name only when that variable is "
"present in the configuration supplied with \\f[B]-c\\f[R].  The generated "
"module configuration includes selected distribution, compression, kernel, "
"locale, timezone, user, and builder values.  It does not include every "
"\\f[B]build.conf\\f[R] value; boot-loader, menu, persistence, snapshot, and "
"most cache or debugging settings are unavailable to ordinary module calls "
"unless a module supplies them explicitly.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"CondinAPT hanya dapat menggunakan nama variabel penuh yang belum dipetakan "
"apabila variabel tersebut tersedia dalam konfigurasi yang disuplai dengan "
"\\f[B]-c\\fR. Konfigurasi modul yang dihasilkan mencakup distribusi, "
"kompresi, kernel, locale, zona waktu, pengguna, dan nilai builder yang "
"dipilih. Tidak semua nilai \\f[B]build.conf\\fR disertakan; boot-loader, "
"menu, persistensi, snapshot, dan sebagian besar pengaturan cache atau "
"debugging tidak tersedia untuk pemanggilan modul biasa kecuali modul "
"tersebut menyediakannya secara eksplisit.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt-minios.7:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "DERIVED VALUES"
msgstr "NILAI TURUNAN"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt-minios.7:149
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]DISTRIBUTION_PROFILE\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]DISTRIBUTION_PROFILE\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:154
msgid ""
"Behavior profile derived from the selected suite, normally "
"\\f[B]debian\\f[R] or \\f[B]ubuntu\\f[R].  Devuan suites use the Debian "
"profile.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Profil perilaku yang diturunkan dari suite yang dipilih, biasanya "
"\\f[B]debian\\fR atau \\f[B]ubuntu\\fR. Suite Devuan menggunakan profil "
"Debian.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt-minios.7:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]INIT_SYSTEM\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]INIT_SYSTEM\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:158
msgid ""
"Derived init-system profile, normally \\f[B]systemd\\f[R] or "
"\\f[B]sysvinit\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Profil init-system turunan, biasanya \\f[B]systemd\\fR atau "
"\\f[B]sysvinit\\fR.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt-minios.7:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] and \\f[B]KERNEL_CAPABILITIES\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] dan \\f[B]KERNEL_CAPABILITIES\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:166
msgid ""
"Resolved kernel values appended to a temporary configuration used only by "
"CondinAPT calls inside the \\f[B]01-kernel\\f[R] build flow.  "
"\\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] is the user setting; "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] is the detected series used by \\f[B]ks\\f[R].  "
"Neither \\f[B]ks\\f[R] nor \\f[B]kc\\f[R] is propagated to ordinary later "
"modules.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Nilai kernel yang telah diresolusikan ditambahkan ke konfigurasi sementara "
"yang hanya digunakan oleh pemanggilan CondinAPT di dalam alur build \\f[B]01-"
"kernel\\f[R].  \\f[B]MINIOS_KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] adalah pengaturan pengguna; "
"\\f[B]KERNEL_SERIES\\f[R] adalah seri yang terdeteksi dan digunakan oleh "
"\\f[B]ks\\f[R].  Baik \\f[B]ks\\f[R] maupun \\f[B]kc\\f[R] tidak diteruskan "
"ke modul-modul berikutnya secara umum.\\fR"

