msgid "Choose a package during planning, not after an APT transaction failure:"
msgstr "Pilih paket saat perencanaan, bukan setelah kegagalan transaksi APT:"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt-minios.7:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "REBUILDING MODULES"
msgstr "MEMBANGUN ULANG MODUL"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt-minios.7:211
msgid ""
"\\f[B]build-modules\\f[R] skips a module whose SquashFS artifact is already "
"present.  After changing a module, remove its existing artifact from the "
"selected work directory\\[cq]s \\f[B]image/\\f[R] tree and rerun "
"\\f[B]minios-live build-modules\\f[R].  The builder invalidates the "
"following non-kernel module chain once an artifact is missing.  Kernel "
"module rebuilding follows separate handling in the builder.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]build-modules\\f[R] melewati modul yang artefak SquashFS-nya sudah "
"ada.  Setelah mengubah modul, hapus artefak yang ada dari pohon \\f[B]image/"
"\\f[R] di direktori kerja yang dipilih lalu jalankan ulang \\f[B]minios-live "
"build-modules\\f[R].  Builder akan menginvalkan rantai modul non-kernel "
"berikut jika artefak hilang.  Proses pembangunan ulang modul kernel "
"mengikuti penanganan terpisah di builder.\\fR"

